# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-08-03 11:18

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:9
translate italian u19a2s1b_d6193e41:

    # "Feeling this strange tug, almost like Reba is calling, I walk down the path towards her."
    "Sentendo questa strana sensazione, quasi come se Reba mi stesse chiamando, percorro il sentiero verso di lei."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:12
translate italian u19a2s1b_a4fdb6df:

    # "After a while of walking, I wonder if I imagined the feeling."
    "Dopo aver camminato per un po’, mi chiedo se quella sensazione fosse solo frutto della mia immaginazione."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:13
translate italian u19a2s1b_5a44d5e1:

    # "There is no indication that this is the right way at all, and no reason to think that Reba would be here."
    "Non c’è alcun segno che indichi che questa sia la strada giusta, né alcun motivo per pensare che Reba possa trovarsi qui."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:16
translate italian u19a2s1b_c423963c:

    # "Then I hear voices coming from up ahead. Yelling and weapons clanging together."
    "Poi sento delle voci provenire da più avanti. Urla e il clangore delle armi che si scontrano."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:20
translate italian u19a2s1b_69a4fcdd:

    # "I run down the path towards the noise and am surprised to see Reba in a clearing ahead, with three men surrounding her."
    "Corro lungo il sentiero verso il rumore e rimango sorpresa nel vedere Reba in una radura più avanti, circondata da tre uomini."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:23
translate italian u19a2s1b_aed8dec2:

    # rb "I told you buttswogglers that if you tried to touch me I'd bash your heads in!"
    rb "Ve l’avevo detto, bastardi, che se aveste provato a toccarmi vi avrei spaccato la testa!"

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:24
translate italian u19a2s1b_a5b2fc7b:

    # rb "Now leave me alone!"
    rb "Ora lasciatemi in pace!"

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:25
translate italian u19a2s1b_7805dc36:

    # "Bandit 1" "Oh, I don't think so, lovely. Now you got us mad."
    "Bandit 1" "Oh, non credo proprio, tesoro. Ora ci hai fatto arrabbiare."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:26
translate italian u19a2s1b_09e8e2db:

    # "Bandit 2" "You might be able to take one of us, but not all three. Not by your lonesome."
    "Bandit 2" "Potresti riuscire a battere uno di noi, ma non tutti e tre. Non da solo."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:29
translate italian u19a2s1b_8248f701:

    # "I pull my sword out of its sheath, holding it in front of me as confidently as I can."
    "Sfodo la spada dal fodero, tenendola davanti a me con tutta la sicurezza possibile."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:30
translate italian u19a2s1b_ee0a4ba4:

    # pc "She's not alone! Get away from her, you... buttswogglers."
    pc "Non è sola! Allontanatevi da lei, voi... idioti."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:33
translate italian u19a2s1b_01d3ae6b:

    # "Bandit 1" "You picked the wrong fight, boy. Should've just kept walking."
    "Bandit 1" "Hai scelto la battaglia sbagliata, ragazzo. Avresti dovuto semplicemente continuare a camminare."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:34
translate italian u19a2s1b_aec1c970:

    # "Bandit 2" "Now we gotta kill you both!"
    "Bandit 2" "Ora dobbiamo uccidervi entrambi!"

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:37
translate italian u19a2s1b_484e806e:

    # "I hear Reba screaming in fury, but my focus is on the guy with the sword charging right at me now."
    "Sento Reba urlare di rabbia, ma la mia attenzione è concentrata sul tizio con la spada che mi sta caricando in questo momento."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:38
translate italian u19a2s1b_9b2b4b2a:

    # "I try my best to block with my sword, but I don't know what the fuck I'm doing."
    "Faccio del mio meglio per parare con la mia spada, ma non so che cazzo sto facendo."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:41
translate italian u19a2s1b_81fc296b:

    # "I've seen sword fighting in movies and stuff, but this is different. It's messier."
    "Ho visto combattimenti con la spada nei film e cose del genere, ma questo è diverso. È più caotico."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:42
translate italian u19a2s1b_50d85c84:

    # "Our weapons smash into each other, but they keep going, his blade sliding dangerously close to my hands and arms."
    "Le nostre armi si scontrano, ma continuano ad avanzare, con la sua lama che mi sfiora pericolosamente le mani e le braccia."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:45
translate italian u19a2s1b_011dca34:

    # "Then I trip over a root, falling backwards."
    "Poi inciampo in una radice e cado all’indietro."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:46
translate italian u19a2s1b_9b11d9fe:

    # "I lose my grip and the sword flies from my hands and clatters across the ground."
    "Perdo la presa e la spada mi vola via dalle mani, cadendo rumorosamente a terra."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:49
translate italian u19a2s1b_f2b252a6:

    # "Bandit 1" "Bad news, boy: you're not very good at swordfighting."
    "Bandit 1" "Brutta notizia, ragazzo: non sei molto bravo a combattere con la spada."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:50
translate italian u19a2s1b_d5514087:

    # "Bandit 1" "Time to die."
    "Bandit 1" "È ora di morire."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:51
translate italian u19a2s1b_3b1d2205:

    # pc "No, wait!"
    pc "No, aspetta!"

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:54
translate italian u19a2s1b_003839a3:

    # "Then Reba smashes her club into the side of the man's head, caving it in and dropping him like a marionette whose strings have been cut."
    "Poi Reba colpisce con la mazza la tempia dell’uomo, spaccandogliela e facendolo cadere come una marionetta a cui sono stati tagliati i fili."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:57
translate italian u19a2s1b_72b62d77:

    # "Once he's on the ground, she slams her club into him a couple more times for good measure."
    "Una volta a terra, gli sferra ancora un paio di colpi con la mazza, per sicurezza."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:59
translate italian u19a2s1b_98c8d795:

    # rb "I warned you!"
    rb "Te l’avevo detto!"

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:61
translate italian u19a2s1b_f68be640:

    # rb "I tole you to stay away from me!"
    rb "Ti avevo detto di starmi alla larga!"

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:63
translate italian u19a2s1b_cc15a689:

    # rb "STUPID!"
    rb "STUPIDO!"

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:65
translate italian u19a2s1b_d3cf4267:

    # rb "DUMB!"
    rb "IDIOTA!"

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:67
translate italian u19a2s1b_d7a4e723:

    # rb "JERKS!"
    rb "IDIOTI!"

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:70
translate italian u19a2s1b_1f493a2c:

    # rb "RAAAAAAAAAAAHHHHHHHHHH!"
    rb "RAAAAAAAAAAAHHHHHHHHHH!"

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:71
translate italian u19a2s1b_ff50a7ed:

    # "I back away a bit on the ground, hoping that she doesn't come after me next."
    "Faccio un passo indietro, sperando che non mi dia la caccia."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:74
translate italian u19a2s1b_ab0cc730:

    # "Then she looks at me, like she had almost forgotten I was here."
    "Poi mi guarda, come se si fosse quasi dimenticata che fossi lì."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:75
translate italian u19a2s1b_77773a08:

    # rb "Dang! That sucked! I hate when people get me like that."
    rb "Cavolo! Che schifo! Odio quando la gente mi prende in giro così."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:76
translate italian u19a2s1b_e09cad3f:

    # rb "Are you okay?"
    rb "Stai bene?"

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:77
translate italian u19a2s1b_bed2a4be:

    # pc "Uh... yeah, I think so. Are you?"
    pc "Ehm... sì, credo di sì. E tu?"

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:80
translate italian u19a2s1b_883c8415:

    # rb "Yeah. They were trying to touch me, but I didn't let them."
    rb "Sì. Stavano cercando di toccarmi, ma non gliel’ho permesso."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:81
translate italian u19a2s1b_fe7a3737:

    # pc "Are you Reba?"
    pc "Sei Reba?"

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:82
translate italian u19a2s1b_8e53d88d:

    # rb "Yeah. How'd you know my name? Do we know each other?"
    rb "Sì. Come fai a sapere il mio nome? Ci conosciamo?"

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:85
translate italian u19a2s1b_9be282fb:

    # pc "Sort of. It's hard to explain. I'm from a different world, where there is another version of you."
    pc "Più o meno. È difficile da spiegare. Vengo da un altro mondo, dove c'è un'altra versione di te."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:86
translate italian u19a2s1b_8d1a1ea3:

    # rb "Another me?"
    rb "Un'altra me?"

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:87
translate italian u19a2s1b_c5e041c4:

    # pc "Yeah. I know, it doesn't make any sense."
    pc "Sì. Lo so, non ha alcun senso."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:88
translate italian u19a2s1b_77d587c6:

    # rb "That's okay. I seen a lot of things I don't understand. Magic and whatnot."
    rb "Va bene così. Ho visto un sacco di cose che non capisco. Magia e roba del genere."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:91
translate italian u19a2s1b_88c8b170:

    # rb "I ain't gotta understand it to know that it's true."
    rb "Non devo per forza capirlo per sapere che è vero."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:92
translate italian u19a2s1b_494dcb66:

    # rb "I feel something between us. I feel like I know you. That's good enough for me."
    rb "Sento qualcosa tra noi. Mi sembra di conoscerti. Per me basta questo."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:93
translate italian u19a2s1b_8fe5bf65:

    # rb "Plus, you saved me from those dummies."
    rb "E poi, mi hai salvato da quegli idioti."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:96
translate italian u19a2s1b_1fc43ebb:

    # pc "I don't think I did much."
    pc "Non credo di aver fatto granché."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:97
translate italian u19a2s1b_3a80bf2f:

    # rb "Yeah, you were pretty lame in the fight, but you distracted them enough that I stood a chance."
    rb "Sì, sei stato piuttosto scarso nel combattimento, ma li hai distratti abbastanza da darmi una possibilità."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:98
translate italian u19a2s1b_6ed0b2ec:

    # rb "I think if I had to take all three, they might have gotten a swing on me. I'm glad to not be injured."
    rb "Penso che se avessi dovuto affrontarli tutti e tre, avrebbero potuto colpirmi. Sono contento di non essermi fatto male."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:99
translate italian u19a2s1b_89bf9b0f:

    # rb "So where are you heading?"
    rb "Allora, dove sei diretto?"

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:102
translate italian u19a2s1b_cab5ada1:

    # pc "North. To the Ice Queen's castle."
    pc "A nord. Al castello della Regina del Ghiaccio."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:103
translate italian u19a2s1b_22920754:

    # rb "That's where I'm heading too! We can travel together!"
    rb "È lì che sto andando anch’io! Possiamo viaggiare insieme!"

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:104
translate italian u19a2s1b_4f1735dd:

    # pc "Sounds good to me."
    pc "Mi sembra un’ottima idea."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:107
translate italian u19a2s1b_f2118212:

    # pc "Why are you going to the Ice Queen?"
    pc "Perché vai dalla Regina del Ghiaccio?"

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:108
translate italian u19a2s1b_54e10752:

    # rb "Lookin' for my brother. Dumbass went to join up with her army. Gonna try to talk some sense into him."
    rb "Sto cercando mio fratello. Quell’idiota è andato ad arruolarsi nel suo esercito. Cercherò di fargli tornare un po’ di buon senso."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:109
translate italian u19a2s1b_9b21e861:

    # rb "Anyway, we better get going. And I have to clean off all this dang blood."
    rb "Comunque, è meglio che ci muoviamo. E devo pulirmi via tutto questo maledetto sangue."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:112
translate italian u19a2s1b_da4050d7:

    # "Reba and I continue down the path north, together now."
    "Io e Reba proseguiamo lungo il sentiero verso nord, ora insieme."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:113
translate italian u19a2s1b_53503d71:

    # "I'm still nervous about all of this, especially after that fight, but it's nice to have somebody with me."
    "Sono ancora nervoso per tutta questa storia, specialmente dopo quel combattimento, ma è bello avere qualcuno con me."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:114
translate italian u19a2s1b_4fb601c4:

    # rb "Gonna have to teach you how to fight a bit. That was embarrassing."
    rb "Dovrò insegnarti un po’ a combattere. È stato imbarazzante."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene1b.rpy:115
translate italian u19a2s1b_95d16ca5:

    # pc "Yeah, good plan."
    pc "Sì, ottima idea."

